#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/parent_collection.rst:5
msgid "Title block parent collection"
msgstr "图框父收藏"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/parent_collection.rst:7
msgid ""
"The parent collection property from a `title block`_ defines the `title "
"block collection`_ to which the `title block`_ belongs."
msgstr ""
"父收藏属性来自 `图框 <title block_>`_ 定义了 `图框 <title block collection_>`_ 所属的 `图框 "
"<title block_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/parent_collection.rst:10
msgid ""
"This property defines the rights from the user to `edit the title block`_. A"
" `title block`_ with `QET title block collection`_ as parent collection can "
"only be read by the user. A `title block`_ with `user title block "
"collection`_ or `project title block collection`_ as parent collection can "
"be read and written (`edited`_) by the user."
msgstr ""
"此属性定义了用户对 `编辑图框 <edit the title block_>`_。A `图框 <title block_>`_ 与 `QET 图框收藏"
" <QET title block collection_>`_ 作为父收藏只能由用户阅读。 A `图框 <title block_>`_ 与 "
"`用户图框收藏 <user title block collection_>`_ 或 `项目图框集 <project title block "
"collection_>`_ 作为父收藏可以读和写(`编辑 <edited_>`_) 由用户进行。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/parent_collection.rst:15
msgid ""
"The parent collection from a `title block`_ can be defined during the `save "
"process`_."
msgstr "从 `图框 <title block_>`_ 的母集可以在 `save process <save process_>`_ 中定义。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/properties/parent_collection.rst:20
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block save PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框保存 PopUP 窗口"
